Login showed only the Vercel logo because malformed/empty API responses and a divide-by-zero produced `NaN`, blocking dashboard render.

- Data shape guards: only set holdings/news when API returns arrays; otherwise clear and surface a helpful error.
- Safe metrics: prevent `NaN` in total change % by handling zero denominators.

```ts
const data = await response.json();
if (Array.isArray(data)) {
  setHoldings(data);
} else {
  setHoldings([]);
  setHoldingsError('Unexpected holdings response format');
}

const denominator = totalValue - totalChange;
const totalChangePercent = denominator !== 0 ? (totalChange / denominator) * 100 : 0;
```

